1. Go to GMIN-HiRE

2. If not already there, create a folder build

3. In build, create a unique folder for your current built, and enter this directory

4. Run FC=gfortran CC=gcc cmake ../../source (instead of gfortran and gcc, you can use other compilers e.g. ifort and icc)

5. If you don't want the standard configuration run ccmake . and alter the current build settings (exit after configuring)

6. run make, the executable OPEP+HiREGMIN should be created



Files needed to run:

 - for GMIN: data - keyword input to set options for run
             start - xyz coordinates
             atomgroups - needed for grouprotation moves (input see GMIN documentation or examples)

 - for potential: 
             ichain_RNA.dat 
             protonated.dat 
             baselist.dat 
             chargeatm_RNA.dat
             scale_RNA.dat   
             bblist.dat
             conf_initiale_RNA.pdb
             parametres_RNA.top  

